SUMMARY: Butter & Egg Days Opening Ceremonies
DESCRIPTION:43rd Annual Butter & Egg Days - Opening Ceremonies\n\nSaturda
 y\, April 11\, Noon to 1 pm\n\nPetaluma Historical Library & Museum\, 20 
 Fourth Street\n\nJoin in the kick off of Petaluma History Week & Butter &
  Egg Days festivities!\n\nJoin City\, Petaluma Museum\, Petaluma Downtown
  Association\, and Petaluma Visitors Program staff to applaud and thank P
 etaluma’s newest Good Eggs\, cheer for the 2026 Grand Marshal\, and get r
 eady for the 2026 Butter & Egg Days Parade and Festival the next weekend 
 on Saturday\, April 18! The 2026 event themed America's Birthday - Petalu
 ma Style invites participants and spectators alike to celebrate the magic
  and charm of our historic town.\n\nVisit ButterAndEggDays.com http://www
 .ButterAndEggDays.com for more information!
