SUMMARY: Botox\, Chemical Peels & More - Aesthetic Event at Devereux Beau
 ty
DESCRIPTION:Botox\, Chemical Peels & More - Aesthetic Event at Devereux B
 eauty\n\nJoin us for an exclusive aesthetic event featuring Rachel Y.\, a
  registered nurse with 14 years of experience and hundreds of five-star r
 eviews. This event offers a comprehensive menu of premium aesthetic treat
 ments in a convenient\, professional setting.\n\nDate: April 24th\, 2026\
 nTime: 10:30 AM - 12:30 PM\nLocation: Devereux Beauty\, 350 2nd St Suite 
 B\, Petaluma\, CA 94952\n\nAvailable Treatments:\n\n  * Botox and Xeomin 
 injections\n  * VI Peel Original\n  * VI Peel Original with PDRN post-pro
 cedure serum\n  * VI Peel Precision Plus Peptides\n  * Microneedling with
  PDRN (face)\n  * Dermal filler treatments\n  * Regenerate and Glow: PDRN
  booster with 3.5% Hyaluronic Acid and Glutathione\n\nWhether you're look
